// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3529293413" "Greetings, {HeroName}. The history files of Ouroboros tell of us a potential threat to the time line. {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} stands to alter the events of the future. We would like you to intervine before the causality curve gets out of control."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2835451106" "You might not of heard of {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} before. They were a little before your time. But we need you to put a stop to them before all of time unravels."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P524746688" "We've discovered that {VillainGroup} has been meddling with time travel. From what I can determine, that's probably because {BOSS_NAME} is helping them."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P431173293" "{BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} is on the loose, and people are scared. Time to make Paragon City a little bit safer."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3171628426" "As the Police band dispatcher rattles off the crimes that put an APB on {BOSS_NAME}, you remember that you'd heard where that villain might be holed up."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3563618376" "{BOSS_NAME} has been on the suspect lists of many heroes for some time. Bringing that rogue in could help a number of investigations."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P202440035" "{BOSS_NAME} has escaped the Zigg? No doubt with the help of cronies among the {VillainGroup}. The streets won't be safe until you've brought the escapee back to justice."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P815128266" "{BOSS_NAME} at large? This can't be good. It will only be a matter of time until {BOSS_NAME} has amassed a group of the {VillainGroup} and takes to the streets. Time to stop this, now."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P452770851" "Does {BOSS_NAME} think that justice can be escaped that easily? Some villains never learn, but that's why heroes like you must confront them."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3563019202" "I'm sure you've heard of {BOSS_NAME}, big name in your time. However, in the past that wasn't the case. Time to show everyone that attemtpting to alter the time stream is a bad idea."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2948975441" "You've heard that {BOSS_NAME} was bad news. Taking care of this situation before innocent people get hurt would be a good idea."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1505680145" "We have uncovered a horrible accident in your very near past. However, our temporal readings inform us that this was no such accident, but the work of {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup}. It's up to Ouroboros to make sure this accident doesn't happen."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1718090325" "You need to go back in time and defeat {BOSS_NAME}. So many things go wrong if this person is allowed to walk the streets of their time."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3397657295" "You've seen the files on {BOSS_NAME}. Excessive force may be the only thing that can stop that maniac."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P792799192" "It sounds like {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} is at it again, and the streets of Paragon City won't be safe until this has been stopped."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1232292093" "Do you remember that attack by the {VillainGroup} when you were just a child? If {BOSS_NAME} was the one behind it, then Ouroboros is interested in making sure he stays out of time time line."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2532280075" "Ouroboros wants to bring {BOSS_NAME} in, but we're going to have a tough time doing it without your help."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1606174114" "Ouroboros mends."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2711689474" "This is something that Mender Silos asked of you specifically."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P218627693" "The battle against the force of time begins right now!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3380777469" "The task before Ouroboros may be impossible, but that's our speciality."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1252639422" "Strike carefully, but quickly {HeroName}"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3465220866" "You'll help us gather the information we need to insure the future of humanity."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2990797186" "The forces of evil won't know what hit them."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2475911431" "{BOSS_NAME} is in for an unforgettable battle."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P232241061" "Did {BOSS_NAME} think that crime would be easy in Paragon City? That's a big mistake."
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P2925740544" "You have defeated {BOSS_NAME} and his {VillainGroup} crew. Mission Accomplished"
// Script Variable RETURNED_STRING :
"P587687779" "You can feel the causality curve ripple past you as you defeat {BOSS_NAME}"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4174844294" "This plan will reinvent evil... Trust me."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3021645580" "Times are going to change."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2615118828" "I've seen the future, my friends."
