"P2903037316" "Nothing can stop us now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2029575890" "The next step is removing all resistance, starting with {HeroName}"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3472627929" "Soon, I'll have my revenge on Paragon City!"
