"P235579690" "The only thing better than being evil is the way innocent people cry out for a hero when you hurt them."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1260427051" "...and he says 'Aren't you a little old to be believing in leprechauns?' Then I threw him out the window! Hah! I love that one."
