// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3123017418" "{BOSS_NAME} is about to have a very, very bad day."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1511303428" "{BOSS_NAME} is trying to hide from justice. That's not going to work."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P522442092" "Finding {BOSS_NAME} wasn't too tough, but now comes the hard part."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
