// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3817011242" "Hello again, {HeroName}. Ouroboros has become aware of another shift in the time line. It is my hope that you would be willing to take care of this problem for us."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3163647447" "There is a maverick time traveller on the loose. Please help us track him down."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P565164713" "Please, {HeroName}, you've got to listen to me. I know everyone else here is talking about bigger issues like the 'coming storm', but there is still other work to do."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1853928438" "There's a person you've run into before. He's slipped back in time somehow. We don't know how he did it, but we need you to go after him and mend the mess he's leaving in his wake."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2246576388" "{BOSS_NAME} has escaped from the future. We're getting reports in your history that {Boss_Name} and {VillainGroup} are doing all sorts of bad things in the near past. Time won't be safe until you've brought them back to justice."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2752923287" "You've seen the past. You know what {BOSS_NAME} will do. Excessive time altering may be the only thing that can stop the paradox effect from getting out of control."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3215768513" "The crystal tells us {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} is at it again. You would think some people would learn not to meddle with the time line. It takes a mind like Mender Silos to percieve the causality of all that is. Would you help us in this?"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1817652692" "There's a individual by the name of {Boss_Name}. We believe this person is a threat to the timeline. Not just because of who this person is, but what they are trying to do. They seek to unravel the fabric of time for their own, petty gain. They must be stopped.<br><br>Please help us."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P568196691" "You would be surprised to know how often someone gains control of time travel technology and begins to use it for their own gain.<br><br>Of course, come to think of it, that's what you're time is known for. If anyone would know what could go wrong it would be you."

